Hi,

on the OpenPrinting Summit last week 
(http://pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/may-2017-virtual.html) there was also 
talked about 3D printing with IPP and CUPS in several sessions:

http://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/ipp/slides/ipp-wg-agenda-may-17.pdf
http://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/liaison/openprinting/presentations/cups-plenary-may-17.pdf
http://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/ipp/wd/wd-smpjt3d10-20170420-rev.pdf

Are there any 3D printing efforts in LibreCAD and similar projects? How 
do you handle this? Would you like to cooperate with PWG and 
OpenPrinting to make 3D printing out of LibreCAD and similar apps "just 
work"?

    Till
